OL,3,GNEWSAPupils to get new school after
OL,4,Ayears of waiting
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils in Harlow will finally get a new
OL,7,Fschool building after several years of
OL,8,Fdisruption.
OL,10,FChildren at Sir Frederick Gibberd
OL,11,FCollege spent two years working in a
OL,12,Ftemporary building while their new
OL,13,Fschool was being manufactured in a
OL,14,FMidlands factory.
OL,16,FDuring the Covid pandemic, 198 separate
OL,17,Fpieces were brought to the Tendring
OL,18,FRoad site, and assembled onsite "like
OL,19,FLego" before opening in 2021. However
OL,20,Fthe building was closed two years later
OL,21,Fdue to concerns about its structural
OL,22,Fresilience in extreme weather.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
