OL,3,GNEWSAPupils to get new school after
OL,4,Ayears of waiting
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarlow Council's planning committee on
OL,7,F4 November unanimously voted for a new
OL,8,Fdesign "much better than its
OL,9,Fpredecessor" to be built on the
OL,10,Fexisting estate.
